{"id":"peligro","lemma":"peligro","pos":"noun","rank":662,"glosses":["danger, peril"],"ipa":"/peˈliɡɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"peligros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-peligro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella está en peligro.","en":"She's in danger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636839"},{"text":"No había peligros aparentes.","en":"There were no visible dangers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735707"},{"text":"¿Qué está en peligro?","en":"What's at stake?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800175"},{"text":"Debemos estar alerta a los peligros.","en":"We must be alert to dangers."},{"text":"¿Está usted en peligro?","en":"Are you in danger?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152153"}]}